			"date": "2025-10-31T20:02:56.393Z",
			"content": "<p>Ah, sorry, that's different. Hm! Not if there is an auto (match system setting) option, I wouldn't need it. I don't know if this case is relevant to your question, but my system preference is Light mode during the day and Night mode at night and for that I might still need the button.</p>",
