			"date": "2025-10-31T20:05:07.417Z",
			"content": "<p>I’m confused, I interpret ‘auto’ as ‘changing automatically based on whether the sun is up’ but I would expect that only as an OS setting. I expect applications to offer options light/dark/system (as in fallback to OS setting).</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
