				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-10-31T20:13:32.391Z",
			"content": "<p>That’s what I’m curious about, yeah!</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:aicwvquqc4nb44clfkmgzwww/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jc5q6x2226",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:aicwvquqc4nb44clfkmgzwww/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jbyvnuu226",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/asuh.com/post/3m4jc5q6x2226",
			"private": true,
			"date": "2025-10-31T20:15:37.599Z",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:jrzyao2holfkgrsfbq2tue27/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jca6xn5k2p",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jbp5j66k2e",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/sjoy.lol/post/3m4jca6xn5k2p",
			"author": {
				"name": "Sara Joy ☠️",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/sjoy.lol",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:jrzyao2holfkgrsfbq2tue27/bafkreiagfp7h4bhwll4eapje73qndnihlfvena227cpggzlph2e54w5yhi"
			},
			"date": "2025-10-31T20:17:00.199Z",
			"content": "<p>Apparently for me, yes 😅</p>\n<p>Based on the way I like to do it, you leave it in auto (color-scheme: light dark;), offer light (color-scheme: light;) or dark (color-scheme: dark;) and if you've used light-dark() on all the colors in the CSS, that's it, you're done.</p>\n<p>Otherwise you have to test the current</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:jrzyao2holfkgrsfbq2tue27/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jca777dk2p",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:jrzyao2holfkgrsfbq2tue27/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jca6xn5k2p",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/sjoy.lol/post/3m4jca777dk2p",
			"author": {
				"name": "Sara Joy ☠️",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/sjoy.lol",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:jrzyao2holfkgrsfbq2tue27/bafkreiagfp7h4bhwll4eapje73qndnihlfvena227cpggzlph2e54w5yhi"
			},
			"date": "2025-10-31T20:17:00.200Z",
			"content": "<p>OS setting, and then set color-scheme to be light or dark based on that, and set up your toggle to match, and keep an event listener on window.matchMedia() and make sure to flip it when the user flip it, UNLESS they've picked a theme manually, and then don't flip it...</p>\n<p>My current main website does</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:jrzyao2holfkgrsfbq2tue27/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jca77acs2p",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:jrzyao2holfkgrsfbq2tue27/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jca777dk2p",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/sjoy.lol/post/3m4jca77acs2p",
			"author": {
				"name": "Sara Joy ☠️",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/sjoy.lol",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:jrzyao2holfkgrsfbq2tue27/bafkreiagfp7h4bhwll4eapje73qndnihlfvena227cpggzlph2e54w5yhi"
			},
			"date": "2025-10-31T20:17:00.201Z",
			"content": "<p>work like that, but I think I prefer the simplicity and clarity of always showing the 3 options. That's how I've done any personal projects since then.</p>\n<p>Anyway I'm both a n00b to big prod projects while also very opinionated about this particular thing, lol. So not sure how seriously to take myself!</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:ci6ypujbbnk3ae7cm74ga3kr/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jccpl72c2t",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/lindakat.com/post/3m4jccpl72c2t",
			"private": true,
			"date": "2025-10-31T20:18:24.726Z",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:vrrdgcidwpvn4omvn7uuufoo/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jch42csc2n",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jbw65enc2e",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/jakelazaroff.com/post/3m4jch42csc2n",
			"author": {
				"name": "Jake Lazaroff",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/jakelazaroff.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:vrrdgcidwpvn4omvn7uuufoo/bafkreihwaff3ctjdb5uq2p7r4yenu3uvkbuzgazvlzavumvzgy2gdtjhje"
			},
			"date": "2025-10-31T20:20:52.021Z",
			"content": "<p>i have all my devices set to change their color scheme at sunrise/sunset so losing the third option would be annoying</p>\n<p>might be a pretty niche edge case though, i'm not sure how big the intersection of \"uses color scheme based on time-of-day\" and \"overrides color schemes on websites\" is</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:aicwvquqc4nb44clfkmgzwww/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jckty4ek26",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:vrrdgcidwpvn4omvn7uuufoo/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jch42csc2n",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/asuh.com/post/3m4jckty4ek26",
			"private": true,
			"date": "2025-10-31T20:22:57.777Z",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:l2wkngwge5j3vq2njktpvctx/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jcmqfw7c25",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/donnie.damato.design/post/3m4jcmqfw7c25",
			"author": {
				"name": "Donnie D'Amato",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/donnie.damato.design",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:l2wkngwge5j3vq2njktpvctx/bafkreifeh3hdolhstjhmmepzcqi6kmd3gahnmycw7wslml7lsaafnb6wke"
			},
			"date": "2025-10-31T20:24:01.146Z",
			"content": "<p>Feedback I've heard is people want to set to one of these sometimes regardless of what the OS setting is.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:da5mfgzbgt6vb3v33gvyyric/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jh5ih3bs2e",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/kanejamison.com/post/3m4jh5ih3bs2e",
			"author": {
				"name": "Kane Jamison",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/kanejamison.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:da5mfgzbgt6vb3v33gvyyric/bafkreiftuvj4l4oio3tf72lqn4uqungay5bcpgj5zenex6wj2txwvepymi"
			},
			"date": "2025-10-31T21:44:58.188Z",
			"content": "<p>If you have an auto setting, I feel like auto should be the default, and you should let people 'override' via using the other two settings. Like - \"I use AM light mode / PM dark mode in a bunch of places but I just don't want it in this app, please stick to light mode 24/7\"</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:3rr66t753ubid4tth7rltsre/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jrayy4h223",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/pierbover.com/post/3m4jrayy4h223",
			"author": {
				"name": "Pier",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/pierbover.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:3rr66t753ubid4tth7rltsre/bafkreig2wz76y2juflrsjs5rq62kvkikvhngrawxzbnkbk3q35ffahtxpa"
			},
			"date": "2025-11-01T00:45:53.604Z",
			"content": "<p>Sometimes when my phone is in dark mode I will switch the website to light mode for reading (docs, article, etc).</p>\n<p>(I have astigmatism and can't read chunks of text in dark mode)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@h_locke/why-dark-mode-causes-more-accessibility-issues-than-it-solves-54cddf6466f5\">medium.com/@h_locke/why...</a></p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:ualrddnru7vctveuus62nkmu/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4k7fbv6b22c",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jbdjd3522b",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/matthewcolwell.com/post/3m4k7fbv6b22c",
			"author": {
				"name": "Matthew Colwell",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/matthewcolwell.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ualrddnru7vctveuus62nkmu/bafkreiex6hcdkrsvubptm222ongw3h7tsezenafv4re5eyxvv25pj7624u"
			},
			"date": "2025-11-01T04:58:49.545Z",
			"content": "<p>I may be a particular type of weird, but I do do this! I often set appearance to explicitly dark in apps/websites even if my system setting is dark. No real justification it just makes me feel better bc it convinces me less things can go wrong.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:slxmn2ejggkwwbzlej2axmx6/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4khnu2duk2c",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4jbsi6plc2e",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mastrojs.bsky.social/post/3m4khnu2duk2c",
			"author": {
				"name": "Mastro.{js,ts}",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mastrojs.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:slxmn2ejggkwwbzlej2axmx6/bafkreicizuiyr3nvt254ufexepmsoerc5gfcpdjg4b43l4hueantbveslm"
			},
			"date": "2025-11-01T07:26:46.944Z",
			"content": "<p>It’s been like that in macOS for a while? But indeed, in iOS they simplified/dumbed it down to:</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:slxmn2ejggkwwbzlej2axmx6/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4kkbfgoqk2c",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:slxmn2ejggkwwbzlej2axmx6/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4khnu2duk2c",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mastrojs.bsky.social/post/3m4kkbfgoqk2c",
			"author": {
				"name": "Mastro.{js,ts}",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mastrojs.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:slxmn2ejggkwwbzlej2axmx6/bafkreicizuiyr3nvt254ufexepmsoerc5gfcpdjg4b43l4hueantbveslm"
			},
			"date": "2025-11-01T08:13:30.211Z",
			"content": "<p>I think in a web GUI you can treat selecting the “system” setting analogous to how macOS treats the “automatic” (day/night) setting.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:fhkc5evmfjrjxuuwjwaxlaji/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4lf5l6pv22w",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/oddward.space/post/3m4lf5l6pv22w",
			"author": {
				"name": "Mugtaba G",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/oddward.space",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:fhkc5evmfjrjxuuwjwaxlaji/bafkreihjmjxbvmczacvuawwabul2ujhtil7kwtoffbenhclctkpnfyvbsy"
			},
			"date": "2025-11-01T16:14:33.052Z",
			"content": "<p>I see it as an option for when you're one someone else's system lol, some people stare into that light. Also if I'm logged in I expect it to save my preference to my acct but some sites don't (like youtube)</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		}
